      "topicName": "/tsp05/cmd/dc_rpm",
      "datatype": "std_msgs/msg/Float32",
      "buttonText": "Stop DC motor",
      "advancedView": false,
      "value": "{\n  \"data\": 0.0\n}",
      "buttonColor": "#e53935",
      "foxglovePanelTitle": "DC motor"
    },
    "Markdown!cal_help": {
      "renderMode": "static",
      "markdown": "**Force sensor (flex) calibration**\n\n1. Hold the flex sensor **straight** and press *Straight = 0 %*.\n2. Bend it as far as it goes in use, **hold**, and press *Bent = 100 %*.\n\nSaved on the Arduino. Force 0-100 % maps to servo 0-180 deg in SENSOR mode. Check the result on the transfer-function plot.\n\nStored points: see *Calibration* gauges.",
      "foxglovePanelTitle": "How to calibrate"
    },
    "Publish!cal_flat": {
      "topicName": "/tsp05/cmd/flex_calibrate",
      "datatype": "std_msgs/msg/String",
      "buttonText": "Straight = 0 %",
      "advancedView": false,
      "value": "{\n  \"data\": \"FLAT\"\n}",
      "buttonColor": "#1e88e5",
      "foxglovePanelTitle": "Calibrate"
    },
    "Publish!cal_bent": {
      "topicName": "/tsp05/cmd/flex_calibrate",
      "datatype": "std_msgs/msg/String",
      "buttonText": "Bent = 100 %",
      "advancedView": false,
      "value": "{\n  \"data\": \"BENT\"\n}",
      "buttonColor": "#fb8c00",
      "foxglovePanelTitle": "Calibrate"
    },
    "Publish!cal_reset": {
      "topicName": "/tsp05/cmd/flex_calibrate",
      "datatype": "std_msgs/msg/String",
      "buttonText": "Reset to defaults",
      "advancedView": false,
      "value": "{\n  \"data\": \"RESET\"\n}",
      "buttonColor": "#757575",
      "foxglovePanelTitle": "Calibrate"
    },
    "Gauge!cal_flat": {
      "path": "/tsp05/sensors/flex/cal_flat_kohm.data",
      "style": "dial",
      "minValue": 0,
      "maxValue": 60,
      "tickInterval": 10,
      "showTicks": true,
      "colorMode": "colormap",
      "colorMap": "turbo",
      "reverse": false,
      "reverseDirection": false,
      "foxglovePanelTitle": "Calibration: straight (kOhm)"
    },
    "Gauge!cal_bent": {
      "path": "/tsp05/sensors/flex/cal_bent_kohm.data",
      "style": "dial",
      "minValue": 0,
      "maxValue": 60,
